&lt;h2 class="smt_head1" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（公募による自己株式の処分）&lt;/span&gt;
